		{"id":"a26fe04274347131","type":"file","file":"Characters/The Hiue Family/Shinigami kun.md","x":560,"y":-640,"width":751,"height":400},
		{"id":"58347e0b3d18fc47","type":"file","file":"Characters/The Sakasai Family/Shinki Sakasai.md","x":560,"y":-1040,"width":751,"height":400},
		{"id":"f6ad27cd671b1c3e","type":"text","text":"# Ideas for Patients\n--- \n- First Client: \n\t- Super wealthy. Kinda an asshole. Maybe a pain in the ass in Ite lowk\n\t- \"I can't thank you enough. The gift of life you've given me is priceless\"\n\t- \"You can start by giving me money.\"\n\t- \"Ah... right, this should be enough...\" (gives her 30k)\n\t- *God, this jellyfish is definitely out of touch... I'll happily take the money though.*\n- Nozaki Family:\n\t- Maybe Yuune? Or maybe Shinigami kun just notices her in the corner and notes how something is off about her (atp she's very young).\n- Futao / Kazuo:\n\t- Fakeout cause lowk that's what did in the guy in the grimm's fairytale.\n- Hiue Family:\n\t- Jirou with the disease in his balls\n\t- Katsuo keeps floating over to him. lol.\n- Moon Jellyfish \n\t- Inverted bell\n\t- Rough shape\n\t- One of these is Sui maybe? \n- Red lantern jellyfish ?\n- Hanakari jellyfish ? (same genus, dif species as prev)\n- Urashima kurage (*urashimea globosa*)\n- Kami kurage (*Spirocodon salator*)\n- Yamaguchi (Shinigami kun has interesting dialog if you choose this one)\n\t- Teri has 2 older siblings, but he is 16 atp.\n\t- Oh lowk the light novel happens around this time. Maybe we can get some of Shima's art as an easter egg\n- Akakurage (*Chrysaora pacifica*)\n- *Mastigias papua*\n- Other *Cassiopea ornata*s\n- *Nemophilema nomurai*\n- Bizen Kurage (*Rhopilema esculentum*)\n- Ebikurage (*Netrostoma setouchiana*)\n- Murasaki Kurage (*Thysanostoma*)\n- Jellyfish from the Kyoto Suizokukan\n\t- Black Kurage\n\t- One of Achlys' godmothers(?) (ik they're *Chrysaora melanaster* but the point still stands)\n- Okikurage\n\t- One of Naito's older siblings? Maybe it gets her to start drawing because she's so sad\n- Andon kurage (*Carybdea brevipedalia*)\n- *Aequora sp* (There's many different species in Japan)\n- Hanagasa kurage\n\t- Taka Ryuu's Aunt\n\t- lowk imply that he was the one who killed her(?)\n\t- Anyways you can't heal her. \n- *Craspedacusta sowerbyi*\n\nNote: I wanna shoot for at least ","x":-860,"y":-3120,"width":1200,"height":1160},
